Subject: [PATCH 31/57] UPSTREAM: mm: multi-gen LRU: fix crash during cgroup
 migration lru_gen_migrate_mm() assumes lru_gen_add_mm() runs prior to itself.
  This isn't true for the following scenario:

    CPU 1                         CPU 2

  clone()
    cgroup_can_fork()
                                cgroup_procs_write()
