Date: Tue, 9 Sep 2025 12:09:19 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 43/57] mm/vmscan: skip reclaim throttle on critical processes

Inspired from:
https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common/+/ed1da72b3c04f1bba7c03e58e73bfde6ca4f70d4%5E%21/#F1

Signed-off-by: Tashfin Shakeer Rhythm <tashfinshakeerrhythm@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: kvsnr113 <kvsnrprojkt113@gmail.com>
---
